{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": false,\n  \"problems\": [\n    \"M34的前提超出了已确立的历史。H36、H38、H39支持他仍然舍不得、仍想靠近但对回应缺乏把握，并且本能地停顿了一下；这些事实不足以确定216–225中他已经持续把不舍和急切压在很小的范围里，更不足以直接推出忍耐持续到身体终于承受不了。新确立的历史第2条又把这一推断固化成事实，构成了未经充分支持的前史和心理机制。\",\n    \"M55把后段逐渐集中的向前感解释为他开始为自己还能强烈地感受而振奋。这比听感所支持的内容更具体：S11-B3强调的是害怕仍在、行动却重新发生，因此停滞有所松动，并不是他开始欣赏或肯定自己强烈的情感。连续的惊慌、力量的累积和向前感可以成立，但最后这层自我振奋并非必要，属于额外增加的心理步骤。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"S11-B1、S11-B2、S11-B3的核心感受都有对应解释，M10尤其清楚地说明了为什么强求和克制都不能解决难受，最终会转向不愿继续退让；M35也解释了压力为何逐次累积。但M34补入了尚未成立的持续压抑前史，M55又增加了听感不足以确定的自我振奋，因此整体不能判为合格。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6cdad6f7-1b4a-4eb0-b67f-20855f14794e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T080942471542Z", "elapsed_seconds": 405.281, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T08:16:27.775258+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d37329962e0c1c5214c3aea2c62bf0ce29cf8d4d28096574ef5e22c52c0fe4e2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools